      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is understandable that in the face of such a profound lack of ultimate meaning, the idea of clinging to small things feels like a denial. When the ultimate picture is bleak, the choices feel incredibly heavy. If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please know that there are people who want to support you right now. You can connect with compassionate listeners by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada.",
